</span> <span begin="23.798" end="24.545">about</span> <span begin="24.545" end="24.745">to</span> <span begin="24.745" end="25.212">be</span> <span begin="25.212" end="25.638">up</span> <span begin="26.158" end="26.998">all</span> <span begin="26.998" end="27.463">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们今晚就要彻夜不眠</span></p></div><div begin="30.823" end="46.014" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.823" end="32.519" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.823" end="31.138">See</span> <span begin="31.138" end="31.429">you</span> <span begin="31.429" end="31.805">over</span> <span begin="31.805" end="32.519">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见你在那边</span></p><p begin="32.616" end="34.545" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.616" end="32.832">In</span> <span begin="32.832" end="32.965">the</span> <span begin="32.965" end="33.139">back</span> <span begin="33.139" end="33.589">of</span> <span begin="33.632" end="33.845">this</span> <span begin="33.845" end="34.545">party</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在派对的角落</span></p><p begin="34.545" end="38.049" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.545" end="34.705">And</span> <span begin="34.705" end="34.868">your</span> <span begin="34.868" end="35.332">girlfriend</span> <span begin="35.332" end="35.705">isn&apos;t</span> <span begin="35.705" end="36.319">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你女朋友不在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="36.406" end="38.049"><span begin="36.406" end="36.643">(Yeah,</span> <span begin="36.643" end="36.803">your</span> <span begin="36.803" end="37.270">girlfriend</span> <span begin="37.270" end="37.670">isn&apos;t</span> <span begin="37.670" end="38.049">here)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 她不在这里</span></span></p><p begin="38.510" end="40.238" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.510" end="38.854">Boy</span> <span begin="38.854" end="39.401">inside</span> <span begin="39.401" end="39.561">a</span> <span begin="39.561" end="40.238">cage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">困在笼中的男孩</span></p><p begin="40.238" end="42.185" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.238" end="40.534">Lookin&apos;</span> <span begin="40.534" end="41.267">angry</span> <span begin="41.267" end="41.480">and</span> <span begin="41.480" end="42.185">tired</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看起来愤怒又疲惫</span></p><p begin="42.185" end="46.014" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.185" end="42.481">Like</span> <span begin="42.481" end="42.734">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="42.734" end="42.961">been</span> <span begin="42.961" end="43.214">up</span> <span begin="43.214" end="43.361">for</span> <span begin="43.361" end="44.012">days</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好像几天没睡</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="44.094" end="46.014"><span begin="44.094" end="44.396">(Like</span> <span begin="44.396" end="44.647">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="44.647" end="44.887">been</span> <span begin="44.887" end="45.180">up</span> <span begin="45.180" end="45.313">for</span> <span begin="45.313" end="46.014">days)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好像几天没睡</span></span></p></div><div begin="46.480" end="1:01.366" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="46.480" end="53.094" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.480" end="46.856">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="46.856" end="47.136">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="47.136" end="47.376">an</span> <span begin="47.376" end="48.536">animal,</span> <span begin="48.536" end="48.736">an</span> <span begin="48.736" end="49.683">animal</span> <span begin="49.683" end="49.936">and</span> <span begin="49.936" end="50.216">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="50.216" end="51.112">closing</span> <span begin="51.112" end="51.379">in</span> <span begin="51.379" end="51.832">on</span> <span begin="51.832" end="53.094">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你是个野兽 野兽 正在逼近我</span></p><p begin="54.120" end="1:01.366" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.120" end="54.517">Yeah,</span> <span begin="54.517" end="54.811">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="54.811" end="55.064">an</span> <span begin="55.064" end="56.157">animal,</span> <span begin="56.157" end="56.411">an</span> <span begin="56.411" end="57.360">animal</span> <span begin="57.360" end="57.624">and</span> <span begin="57.624" end="57.851">it</span> <span begin="57.851" end="58.317">just</span> <span begin="58.317" end="58.811">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="58.811" end="59.077">be</span> <span begin="59.077" end="59.544">this</span> <span begin="59.544" end="1:01.366">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 你是个野兽 野兽 事情不能就这样</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.193" end="1:16.603" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:01.193" end="1:05.491" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.193" end="1:01.521">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:01.521" end="1:01.748">I</span> <span begin="1:01.748" end="1:02.161">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:02.161" end="1:02.628">see</span> <span begin="1:02.628" end="1:03.188">straight</span> <span begin="1:03.188" end="1:03.431">and</span> <span begin="1:03.431" end="1:03.681">my</span> <span begin="1:03.681" end="1:03.935">hands</span> <span begin="1:03.935" end="1:04.335">are</span> <span begin="1:04.335" end="1:05.491">tied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我眼神恍惚 双手被束缚</span></p><p begin="1:05.491" end="1:08.836" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.491" end="1:05.740">I</span> <span begin="1:05.740" end="1:05.969">could</span> <span begin="1:05.969" end="1:06.207">be</span> <span begin="1:06.207" end="1:06.463">your</span> <span begin="1:06.463" end="1:06.943">type</span> <span begin="1:06.943" end="1:07.209">from</span> <span begin="1:07.209" end="1:07.436">your</span> <span begin="1:07.436" end="1:07.876">zombie</span> <span begin="1:07.876" end="1:08.836">bite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被你咬上一口 我就会变成你的同类</span></p><p begin="1:08.836" end="1:14.052" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.836" end="1:09.196">No,</span> <span begin="1:09.196" end="1:09.422">I</span> <span begin="1:09.422" end="1:09.889">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:09.889" end="1:10.289">see</span> <span begin="1:10.289" end="1:10.769">straight,</span> <span begin="1:10.769" end="1:11.022">but</span> <span begin="1:11.022" end="1:11.249">the</span> <span begin="1:11.249" end="1:12.028">feeling&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:12.028" end="1:14.052">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 我眼神恍惚 但感觉美妙</span></p><p begin="1:13.253" end="1:16.603" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.253" end="1:13.450">I</span> <span begin="1:13.450" end="1:13.677">could</span> <span begin="1:13.677" end="1:13.904">be</span> <span begin="1:13.904" end="1:14.157">your</span> <span begin="1:14.157" end="1:14.650">type</span> <span begin="1:14.650" end="1:14.797">from</span> <span begin="1:14.797" end="1:15.144">your</span> <span begin="1:15.144" end="1:15.557">zombie</span> <span begin="1:15.557" end="1:16.603">bite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被你咬上一口 我就会变成你的同类</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.603" end="1:21.381" itunes:songPart="Refrain"><p begin="1:16.603" end="1:21.381" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.603" end="1:17.065">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:17.065" end="1:17.665">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:17.665" end="1:18.345">about</span> <span begin="1:18.345" end="1:18.598">to</span> <span begin="1:18.598" end="1:19.105">be</span> <span begin="1:19.105" end="1:19.451">up</span> <span begin="1:20.025" end="1:20.867">all</span> <span begin="1:20.867" end="1:21.381">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我们今晚就要彻夜不眠</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.623" end="1:39.500" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="1:24.623" end="1:26.284" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.623" end="1:24.885">Think</span> <span begin="1:24.885" end="1:25.175">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:25.175" end="1:25.535">really</span> <span begin="1:25.535" end="1:26.284">sly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自认为很狡猾</span></p><p begin="1:26.284" end="1:28.232" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.284" end="1:26.559">Like</span> <span begin="1:26.559" end="1:26.746">a</span> <span begin="1:26.746" end="1:27.196">lion</span> <span begin="1:27.426" end="1:27.586">on</span> <span begin="1:27.586" end="1:27.719">the</span> <span begin="1:27.719" end="1:27.906">hunt</span> <span begin="1:27.906" end="1:28.232">for</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像狮子一般狩猎</span></p><p begin="1:28.232" end="1:31.896" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.232" end="1:28.520">This</span> <span begin="1:28.520" end="1:29.013">kitten</span> <span begin="1:29.013" end="1:29.426">over</span> <span begin="1:29.426" end="1:30.075">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这只小猫咪在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:30.230" end="1:31.896"><span begin="1:30.230" end="1:30.499">(This</span> <span begin="1:30.499" end="1:30.979">kitten</span> <span begin="1:30.979" end="1:31.432">over</span> <span begin="1:31.432" end="1:31.896">here)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这只小猫咪在这里</span></span></p><p begin="1:32.027" end="1:33.840" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.027" end="1:32.294">See,</span> <span begin="1:32.294" end="1:32.451">the</span> <span begin="1:32.451" end="1:32.705">bar</span> <span begin="1:32.705" end="1:32.921">is</span> <span begin="1:32.921" end="1:33.267">gettin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:33.267" end="1:33.840">dry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看吧 酒吧的气氛冷却</span></p><p begin="1:33.840" end="1:35.919" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.840" end="1:34.059">And</span> <span begin="1:34.059" end="1:34.285">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:34.285" end="1:34.845">starin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:34.845" end="1:34.992">at</span> <span begin="1:34.992" end="1:35.139">the</span> <span begin="1:35.139" end="1:35.919">sunrise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你凝视着日出的阳光</span></p><p begin="1:35.919" end="1:37.689" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.919" end="1:36.114">Bet</span> <span begin="1:36.114" end="1:36.300">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:36.300" end="1:36.660">thirsty</span> <span begin="1:36.660" end="1:37.010">over</span> <span begin="1:37.010" end="1:37.689">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在那边一定口渴难耐</span></p><p begin="1:37.751" end="1:39.500" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.751" end="1:37.919">I</span> <span begin="1:37.919" end="1:38.063">bet</span> <span begin="1:38.063" end="1:38.207">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:38.207" end="1:38.607">thirsty</span> <span begin="1:38.607" end="1:38.967">over</span> <span begin="1:38.967" end="1:39.500">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我敢说你在那边一定口渴难耐</span></p></div><div begin="1:40.220" end="1:54.644" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:40.220" end="1:48.644" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.220" end="1:40.532">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:40.532" end="1:40.812">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:40.812" end="1:41.092">an</span> <span begin="1:41.092" end="1:42.241">animal,</span> <span begin="1:42.241" end="1:42.508">an</span> <span begin="1:42.508" end="1:43.508">animal</span> <span begin="1:43.508" end="1:43.761">and</span> <span begin="1:43.761" end="1:44.015">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:44.015" end="1:44.828">closing</span> <span begin="1:44.828" end="1:45.095">in</span> <span begin="1:45.095" end="1:45.561">on</span> <span begin="1:45.561" end="1:47.041">me</span><span ttm:role="x-